OL,4,B'World's best could've lost 4-0' - but 
OL,5,Bshould Man Utd have done more at       
OL,6,BAnfield?                               
OL,7,GMauricio Pochettino believes even the  
OL,8,Gbest team in the world could have      
OL,9,Gconceded four goals at Liverpool in    
OL,10,GManchester United's circumstances -    
OL,11,Gbut should the struggling Red Devils   
OL,12,Ghave done more in another              
OL,13,Gdisappointing defeat?                  
OL,15,FThe former Tottenham and Chelsea       
OL,16,Fmanager's first match in charge of     
OL,17,FUnited got off to a dreadful start as  
OL,18,Fthey had defender Leny Yoro sent off   
OL,19,Fin the eighth minute and were 2-0 down 
OL,20,Fby the 13th minute.                    
